        <tr id="comment-body-1737961"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Hi <a href="https://jira-zurichna.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Ae7f97e64-9a80-4599-afa7-3a5624f3db17" class="user-hover" rel="712020:e7f97e64-9a80-4599-afa7-3a5624f3db17" data-account-id="712020:e7f97e64-9a80-4599-afa7-3a5624f3db17" accountid="712020:e7f97e64-9a80-4599-afa7-3a5624f3db17" rel="noreferrer">Christine Clowser</a> , please see my below queries and let me know what to consider?</p>

<ol>
	<li>Under <b>coverage extensions</b>, all limit fields to be mandatory or optional? If optional then what to print when it’s empty?</li>
</ol>


<p>2. Is below requirement applying only to Coverage extensions?</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://jira-zurichna.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/1517270" alt="image-20260630-145753.png" width="660" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>3, Do we need to consider all below fields for above <b>a</b> point in number 5?</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://jira-zurichna.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/1517269" alt="image-20260630-153716.png" width="645" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>FYI: <a href="https://jira-zurichna.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Ac5672abc-47de-4d3b-b75c-674d899548f3" class="user-hover" rel="712020:c5672abc-47de-4d3b-b75c-674d899548f3" data-account-id="712020:c5672abc-47de-4d3b-b75c-674d899548f3" accountid="712020:c5672abc-47de-4d3b-b75c-674d899548f3" rel="noreferrer">neha.dhilor@zurich.com</a> </p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-1738176"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:e7f97e64-9a80-4599-afa7-3a5624f3db17"
                id="word_commented_712020:e7f97e64-9a80-4599-afa7-3a5624f3db17"
