<ol>
	<li>Named Insured is still not pulling from the info entered in ezdocs.  It’s pulling from UWD seemingly.  It should pull from the info input in ezdocs<br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://jira-zurichna.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/1531684" alt="image-20260717-144347.png" width="564" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
	<li>Soft Costs in the Delay in Completion Endst ZC 6538 - Additional Interest and Financing Expense - When Soft costs has a limit, it opens a limit field up in the endst to be completed for Add’l Intereste.  If you do not fill it in, the quote page shows Add’l Interest as “Not Insured” which is incorrect.  If a Soft Cost limit is entered on ZC6538, the Additional Interest and Finance Expense limit should automatically shows as “Included in Soft Costs Limit”  (that’s what ezdocs currently does with the BRPT upload also.)<br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://jira-zurichna.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/1531685" alt="image-20260717-144859.png" width="957" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
